    <preface>
      <p>Australian Human Rights Commission Amendment (Costs Protection) Act 2024</p>
      <p>No. 89, 2024</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Australian Human Rights Commission Act 1986</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Amendments	3</p>
      <p><ref href="#part-1">Part 1</ref>—Main amendments	3</p>
      <p>Australian Human Rights Commission Act 1986	3</p>
      <p><ref href="#part-2">Part 2</ref>—Consequential amendments	5</p>
